OL,3,GNEWSAMonth long clean-up campaign
OL,4,Alaunched
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month long community clean-up
OL,7,Fcampaign has been launched with a beach
OL,8,Flitter pick.
OL,10,FDurham County Council is encouraging
OL,11,Fresidents, schools, community groups
OL,12,Fand businesses to take part in its Big
OL,13,FAutumn Clean throughout September.
OL,15,FThe campaign was launched with Durham
OL,16,FWildlife Trust at a litter pick at
OL,17,FCrimdon beach, with 52 volunteers
OL,18,Fcollecting 35 bags of waste including a
OL,19,Ftyre and a carpet.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
