OL,3,GNEWSAMonth long clean-up campaign
OL,4,Alaunched
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform-led authority's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for environment Kyle Genner
OL,8,Fsaid: "People across County Durham
OL,9,Frightly want to live in a clean and
OL,10,Ftidy environment but, like many places
OL,11,Facross the UK, litter has become a real
OL,12,Fissue."
